sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User (Browser)
    participant Frontend as Frontend (React)
    participant ReportAPI as Report API (FastAPI)
    participant AuthService as Auth Service (FastAPI)
    participant Redis as Redis (Session Store)
    participant Keycloak as Keycloak (IdP)
    participant CRM as CRM DB (PostgreSQL)
    participant ClickHouse as ClickHouse (OLAP)

    Note over User,ClickHouse: 1. Запрос отчёта с датами

    User->>Frontend: Выбирает даты и нажимает "Get Report"
    Frontend->>Frontend: Формирует GET /reports?start_date=...&end_date=...
    Frontend->>ReportAPI: GET /reports<br/>Cookie: session_id_old

    Note over ReportAPI,AuthService: 2. Валидация сессии

    ReportAPI->>ReportAPI: Получает session_id из cookie
    ReportAPI->>AuthService: POST /session/validate<br/>Cookie: session_id_old
    
    AuthService->>Redis: GET session:{session_id_old}
    Redis-->>AuthService: Session data (user, tokens)
    
    alt Session not found
        AuthService-->>ReportAPI: {valid: false}
        ReportAPI-->>Frontend: 401 Unauthorized
        Frontend->>User: Redirect to Login
    else Session found
        AuthService->>AuthService: Check access_token expiry
        AuthService->>AuthService: current_time vs expires_at
        
        alt access_token expired
            AuthService->>Keycloak: POST /token (refresh_token)
            Keycloak-->>AuthService: new access_token, new refresh_token
            AuthService->>Redis: UPDATE session tokens
        end
        
        AuthService->>AuthService: Rotate session (session fixation protection)
        AuthService->>Redis: DELETE session:{session_id_old}
        AuthService->>Redis: SET session:{session_id_new}
        AuthService-->>ReportAPI: {valid: true, user, new_session_id}
    end

    Note over ReportAPI,ClickHouse: 3. Получение данных для отчёта

    ReportAPI->>CRM: SELECT id FROM customers WHERE email = {user_email}
    CRM-->>ReportAPI: user_id (numeric)
    
    ReportAPI->>ClickHouse: SELECT<br/>    toStartOfFiveMinute(signal_time) as interval_start,<br/>    prosthesis_type,<br/>    avg(signal_frequency) as avg_frequency,<br/>    avg(signal_duration) as avg_duration,<br/>    avg(signal_amplitude) as avg_amplitude,<br/>    count() as signal_count<br/>FROM telemetry_stat<br/>WHERE user_id = {user_id}<br/>  AND signal_time BETWEEN start_date AND end_date<br/>GROUP BY interval_start, prosthesis_type<br/>HAVING count() > 0<br/>ORDER BY interval_start, prosthesis_type
    ClickHouse-->>ReportAPI: Aggregated telemetry data
    
    ReportAPI->>ReportAPI: Format data (JSON)

    Note over ReportAPI,Frontend: 4. Ответ с данными и ротацией сессии

    alt new_session_id present
        ReportAPI->>ReportAPI: Add header X-New-Session-Id
        ReportAPI-->>Frontend: 200 OK + report JSON + X-New-Session-Id header
        Frontend->>Frontend: Parse report data and render table
        Frontend->>Frontend: Detect X-New-Session-Id header
        Frontend->>AuthService: POST /auth/refresh-cookie<br/>{session_id: new_session_id}
        AuthService->>Redis: GET session:{new_session_id}
        Redis-->>AuthService: Session data
        AuthService->>Frontend: Set-Cookie: session_id=new_session_id
        Frontend->>Frontend: Update stored cookie
    else no rotation
        ReportAPI-->>Frontend: 200 OK + report JSON
        Frontend->>Frontend: Parse report data and render table
    end

    Note over Frontend,User: 5. Отображение отчёта

    Frontend-->>User: Display report table with metrics
    User->>Frontend: Click "Download JSON"
    Frontend->>Frontend: Save report as JSON file